{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating action commits from sensor-driven state. The specification enforces the always-turn-right recovery policy: move_forward is only allowed when path_clear is true, and rotate_clockwise is the only recovery action after any obstacle event. Recovery states only allow rotate_clockwise, and return to forward progress only after path_clear.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion (move_forward, rotate_clockwise) and perception (path_clear, obstacle_front, obstacle_left, obstacle_right)",
    "Specification automaton binds path_clear to move_forward, and any obstacle event to rotate_clockwise recovery, returning to forward progress only after path_clear"
  ],
